  "prefLabel": "Gcd 403.04 Town Clerk Responsibilities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gcd 403.04 Town Clerk Responsibilities. The town clerk of each town or municipality shall determine the process by which permanently registered dogs that are service animals will be tracked for town purposes and ensure that town service animal owners are not required to participate, in any way, with an annual renewal of such dog’s registration or licensing.\n\nSource. #10341, eff 5-17-13; ss by #13811, eff 11-23-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gcd100-400.html"
